#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1019
msgid "Pro commercial core · implementation gated"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1020
msgid "Versioned Templates, immutable revisions, six factory design families, deterministic assignments, lifecycle controls, canonical Render Plan Preview, and the full planned DSN-01 through DSN-08 Designer foundation are implemented. Designer edits the same versioned certloom-layout revision model: historical v1/v2 layouts remain readable and immutable, explicit v3 upgrades create a new immutable revision, Code 128 remains bound only to credential.display_number, and canonical bullet/numbered lists resolve through the shared text Render Plan path. DSN-08 now centralizes built-in element schema availability, allowed properties, validation/resolver/renderer mappings, inspector groups, merge requirements and palette defaults behind one closed typed registry; no unversioned filter or arbitrary HTML/CSS callback can mutate it. Recovery autosave remains personal/non-authoritative, manual save remains the only revision-authority path, and FONT-02 still owns controlled local font manifests. Publication and production artifact authority remain fail-closed behind renderer release authority. The P0 Manual Issuance golden path, premium Credential Management workspace and reviewed Bulk Issuance workflow are implemented inside the normalized-domain admin-preview gate: administrators can issue one credential, inspect immutable Version lineage, perform reviewed lifecycle or Program/Batch corrections, then scale through protected CSV review and durable per-row idempotent issuance without rewriting historical snapshots; Email Delivery is next."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1021
msgid "Designer foundation complete · Manual + Bulk Issuance + Credential Management implemented · publication/artifact authority gated · Email Delivery next"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1025
msgid "P0 issuance workflow · implementation gated"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1026
msgid "Manual Issuance is implemented inside the normalized-domain admin-preview gate with existing/new Recipient selection, active Program and verified published-Template selection, mutation-free review, exact SHA-256 confirmation, backdating/permanent/explicit expiry choices, established numbering policy reuse, bounded credential-specific custom merge values, canonical browser Preview, atomic Series/Version/event creation, retry idempotency and an immutable issuance snapshot. Credential Management provides a bounded registry, immutable Version inspection, status/verification workspace, reviewed lifecycle actions and immutable-successor Program/Batch corrections. Bulk Issuance now adds protected CSV review, SHA-256 confirmation, durable bounded per-row issuance, progress and row-level outcomes through the same Manual Issuance truth path. Email Delivery is next. Normalized public authority and PDF/PNG/JPEG exports stay fail-closed until final database and renderer acceptance."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1027
msgid "Manual + Bulk Issuance + Credential Management implemented · acceptance gated · Email Delivery next"
msgstr ""

